<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8" />
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
<title>Goldcoin White Paper</title>

<style>
    body {
        margin: 0;
        font-family: "Poppins", sans-serif;
        background: #0b0c10;
        color: #eaeaea;
    }

    .gradient-bg {
        background: linear-gradient(145deg, #0a0a0a, #111113);
        min-height: 100vh;
    }

    header {
        padding: 20px;
        border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 215, 0, 0.2);
    }

    .container {
        max-width: 900px;
        margin: auto;
        padding: 20px;
    }

    .back-btn {
        display: inline-flex;
        align-items: center;
        padding: 8px 14px;
        border: 1px solid gold;
        background: transparent;
        color: gold;
        border-radius: 8px;
        cursor: pointer;
        text-decoration: none;
        font-weight: 500;
        transition: 0.3s;
    }

    .back-btn:hover {
        background: gold;
        color: black;
    }

    h1 {
        text-align: center;
        font-size: 30px;
        font-weight: bold;
        background: linear-gradient(to right, gold, #f5e28b);
        -webkit-background-clip: text;
        color: transparent;
        margin-top: 10px;
    }

    .card {
        background: #141414;
        border: 1px solid rgba(255, 215, 0, 0.2);
        border-radius: 14px;
        padding: 25px;
        margin-bottom: 25px;
        box-shadow: 0 0 25px rgba(255, 215, 0, 0.06);
    }

    .card-title {
        font-size: 22px;
        font-weight: bold;
        margin-bottom: 15px;
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 10px;
        color: gold;
    }

    .card p {
        line-height: 1.7;
        color: #cfcfcf;
        font-size: 16px;
    }

    .section-title {
        font-size: 19px;
        margin-top: 20px;
        font-weight: 600;
        color: #ffffff;
    }

    .download-btn {
        padding: 14px 30px;
        background: linear-gradient(to right, gold, #f5e28b);
        color: black;
        border: none;
        border-radius: 10px;
        font-size: 18px;
        margin-top: 10px;
        cursor: not-allowed;
        opacity: 0.6;
        font-weight: 600;
        display: inline-flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 8px;
    }

    .center {
        text-align: center;
    }

    .icon {
        font-size: 24px;
        color: gold;
    }
</style>
</head>

<body>

<div class="gradient-bg">

    <!-- Header -->
    <header>
        <div class="container" style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;">
            <a href="/" class="back-btn">⬅ Back to Home</a>
        </div>
        <h1>Goldcoin White Paper</h1>
    </header>

    <main class="container">

        <!-- INTRODUCTION -->
        <div class="card">
            <div class="card-title"><span class="icon">📄</span> Goldcoin Technical White Paper</div>
            <p>
                Goldcoin introduces a next-generation approach to digital mining by combining 
                blockchain security with user-friendly mobile technology.  
                This document explains the architecture, algorithms, and economic model behind 
                the Goldcoin ecosystem.
            </p>
        </div>

        <!-- TECHNICAL OVERVIEW -->
        <div class="card">
            <div class="card-title"><span class="icon">⚙️</span> Technical Overview</div>

            <div class="section-title">Consensus Algorithm</div>
            <p>
                Goldcoin uses a hybrid Proof-of-Work + Proof-of-Stake consensus system, 
                delivering strong security and efficiency across all devices.
            </p>

            <div class="section-title">Mobile Mining Engine</div>
            <p>
                Our Mobile Mining Engine (MME) allows smooth, power-optimized mining on 
                smartphones without overheating or battery drain, utilizing advanced 
                performance balancing.
            </p>

            <div class="section-title">Blockchain Architecture</div>
            <p>
                The system runs on a scalable sharded blockchain with dynamic load 
                distribution ensuring fast transaction times and robust network integrity.
            </p>
        </div>

        <!-- SECURITY -->
        <div class="card">
            <div class="card-title"><span class="icon">🔐</span> Security & Privacy</div>

            <div class="section-title">Cryptographic Protection</div>
            <p>
                Goldcoin implements AES-256 encryption with Elliptic Curve Cryptography (ECC) 
                ensuring complete data protection and secure wallet operations.
            </p>

            <div class="section-title">Privacy Layers</div>
            <p>
                Zero-knowledge proofs and ring signatures safeguard user identities while 
                keeping transactions transparent on the blockchain.
            </p>

            <div class="section-title">Multi-Layer Security Model</div>
            <p>
                Additional layers include biometric login, 2FA, and hardware-verified 
                encryption for enhanced protection.
            </p>
        </div>

        <!-- ECONOMIC MODEL -->
        <div class="card">
            <div class="card-title"><span class="icon">💰</span> Economic Model</div>

            <div class="section-title">Mining Rewards</div>
            <p>
                Mining rewards follow a halving cycle every 210,000 blocks starting from 
                50 GC per block — ensuring a long-term deflationary system.
            </p>

            <div class="section-title">Transaction Fees</div>
            <p>
                Fees automatically adjust based on network usage, ensuring optimal miner 
                rewards while maintaining system affordability.
            </p>
        </div>

        <!-- DOWNLOAD -->
        <div class="card center">
            <h2 class="section-title">Complete White Paper</h2>
            <p>
                The downloadable version containing extended algorithms,  
                diagrams, and developer documentation will be available soon.
            </p>

            <button class="download-btn">📄 Download PDF (Coming Soon)</button>
        </div>

    </main>

</div>

</body>
</html>
